{
  "meta": {
    "source": "https://api.star-citizen.wiki/api/starsystems (paginated via page[number]=1..3) for systems+position+affiliation; per-system https://api.star-citizen.wiki/api/starsystems/{CODE}?include=jumppoints for jump-point connections",
    "coordinate_units": "Galactic light-years (RSI/star-citizen.wiki starmap space). Sol at origin (0,0,0); values range roughly -75..+125 per axis, max magnitude ~139 ly. Field source: each system's position.{x,y,z}.",
    "system_count": 90,
    "notes": "Affiliation = name of first entry in the API 'affiliation' array (UEE, Vanduul, Xi'an, Banu, Unclaimed, Developing). in_game=true only for STANTON and PYRO (the only playable systems as of this data); all others false including Sol/Terra/Nyx. Jump points: the API stores each (bidirectional, direction='B') jump point on only ONE of its two endpoint systems, so the raw per-system lists are asymmetric. They have been SYMMETRIZED here: if system A's record lists a jump to B, B's jump_points also include A. After symmetrization, 78 of 90 systems have >=1 jump connection; the remaining 12 have none in the source (isolated/unconnected on the wiki starmap). 'status' codes in source were P=playable-region/available, M=Vanduul/military, N=non-accessible; not exported. No coordinate gaps: all 90 systems have x/y/z."
  },
